WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:56.710 --> 00:02:00.380
Those're cannonballs!

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:01.320
Hmm?

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.820
Huh? That was way off!

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:05.490
What are you guys doing?

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:07.390
Cannon practice!

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:15.660
Awesome! You hit it on your first try!

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:20.000
Whadya think?! I'm awesome when
it comes to aiming! Impressed?!

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.340
It's settled! You're our sniper!

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:23.840
Come out, you damn pirates!

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:26.340
Hmm? That voice...

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:28.510
What the... What the...
Who are you?!

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:29.010
"Sea"
What the... What the...
Who are you?!

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:30.610
"Sea"
Are you nameless pirate wannabes
trying to kill my partner?!

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:34.680
Are you nameless pirate wannabes
trying to kill my partner?!

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:38.350
I dunno what's going on,
but stop breaking our ship!

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:42.980
L-lost by a hair...

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:50.360
<i>"Famous Cook.
Sanji of the Sea Restaurant."</i>

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:03.310
Say, where're you taking me to today?

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:07.150
To the most wonderful
restaurant in the world.

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:12.940
Don't tell me... there's one
in the middle of the ocean?

00:03:15.990 --> 00:03:18.390
Here's to your beauty...

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:26.290
Well, just wait until you see it...

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:45.350
Hey, if it isn't Johnny!

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:46.510
What?

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:51.680
B-Big Bro Zoro!

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:58.370
Wh-why are you on
a pirate ship like this?!

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.870
Is something wrong?
Yosaku isn't with you?

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:01.800
Well...

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.140
What? Does Zoro know that guy?

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:08.970
What's going on?

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:15.820
Y-Yosaku is...

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:21.560
He's sick?

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.990
Although he was full of life
up until a few days ago,

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:30.330
now he keeps getting pale
suddenly and then fainting!

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:32.660
I have no idea what's causing it...

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:39.670
In the end, his teeth fell out and his old
wound opened up and started bleeding.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:43.010
I didn't know what to do any more...

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:48.180
so we were on a rocky island
letting him rest quietly. But then...

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:57.020
a cannonball came flying
from this ship...

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.970
--W-we're sorry!
--W-we're sorry!

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:14.970
Sorry doesn't cut it...

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:20.150
Isn't that right, partner?

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:26.320
Big Bro... Is he going to die?

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:32.490
Are you all stupid?

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:34.160
What'd you say?!

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:41.340
--Wh-what're you doing?!
--Ouch!

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:45.340
If you mock my partner's death,
you'll pay for it-

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:48.780
Luffy! Usopp! Remember we have
limes in the storage?

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:52.010
Are you listening?!
Bring them here. Now!

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:53.350
--Y-yes ma'am!
--Y-yes ma'am!

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:55.840
<i>--Out of my way!
--Out of my way!</i>

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:07.630
It's scurvy.

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.230
Scurvy?

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:12.300
If we weren't too late,
he'll be fine in just a few days.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.970
R-really, Big Sis?!

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:17.640
Big Sis, is he really...

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:21.480
Stop... calling me that.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:26.650
In the past, it was a hopeless disease
that accompanied sea journeys.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:30.320
--Here, drink it. Drink a lot.
--Here... drink more. Drink more.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:34.820
But the cause was simply a deficiency
of plant-derived nutrients.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:37.160
Ships in the past didn't
carry fresh fruits

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.830
and vegetables since
they weren't storable, so...

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:42.000
Okay now. Put them all in his mouth.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.830
Now he'll be fine.

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:48.670
You're amazing! You're like a doctor!

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:54.010
Well, I always thought you were good.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.010
Yeah, you're right. She is.

00:06:56.010 --> 00:07:00.680
You should know at least that much!
You could die if you don't!

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:05.790
Wha...

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:10.960
--Yaay! Yaay! Yaay!
--Yaay! Yaay! Yaay!

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.960
All those nutrients revived me!

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:14.960
All right, partner!

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:17.960
There's no way you can
recover this quickly!

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:23.640
Sorry for not introducing
ourselves first.

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:25.970
My name is Johnny.

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:28.140
I'm Yosaku.

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:32.410
The pirate bounty hunter duo!

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:34.980
We used to be colleagues
of Big Bro Zoro.

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:37.650
Glad to make your acquaintance.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:42.820
I never thought that
I'd see you guys here...

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:45.160
But again, we're surprised...

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:48.490
We never imagined that the pirate
hunter Zoro became a pirate...

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:51.670
Yeah, I know...

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.330
Big Bro...

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:01.440
H-hey, partner?!

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:14.460
This is a lesson.

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:16.860
Yeah. There're pitfalls like this

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:19.130
when you travel on
the sea for a long time...

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:21.460
Which means on the ship, we have to

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:25.800
consider the distribution of
nutrients using limited kinds of food...

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:30.130
When we think about it carefully,
it's a necessary ability...

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:35.310
A necessary ability, huh?

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:37.140
Okay then! A seafaring cook!

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:38.310
--What?
--What?

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:40.650
Let's go find a seafaring cook!

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:44.990
Aha! Then we'll be able to eat
yummy food even on the ship!

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:47.820
Exactly!

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:53.330
If you're looking for a cook like that,
there's a perfect place for that.

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:56.500
All right! Where's it?

00:08:56.500 --> 00:09:02.270
But this place is close
to the Grand Line, and...

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:07.610
you hear rumors there about the hawk-
eyed man you've been looking for...

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:10.940
We'll head...

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.610
north-northeast!

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:13.780
Yes!

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:14.940
All right!

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.460
Our destination is...

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:36.970
the Sea Restaurant...

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.960
Baratie!

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.640
--Whoa!
--Whoa!

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.650
What do you think, everyone?!

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:48.050
Whoa! It's a huge fish!

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:51.990
--How lovely!
--That's pretty funky!

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:54.650
Right?! Just like
I told you, right?!

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.660
Wh-what the...

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:03.330
At a place like this...

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.660
A Navy ship...

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:12.010
S-surely they're not gonna
shoot at us, are they?

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:15.680
Hmph! What an unpleasant
bunch we've run into...

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.040
Wh-when did they...

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:28.020
I've never seen that pirate flag.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.020
Darn it!

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:33.020
We're not pirates!

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:40.200
I'm Iron Fist Fullbody,
Lieutenant at Navy Headquarters!

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:44.470
Hey, who's your captain?!
Come out and state your name!

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:46.210
I'm Luffy!

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:49.040
I'm Usopp!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:52.450
We just made our pirate flag
the day before yesterday!

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:56.380
And I'm the one who drew it!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:11:00.050
Hmph! Oh, you're just... Hmm?

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:05.660
You two over there,
I remember seeing you before.

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:09.000
If I remember correctly, you're a bounty
hunter duo going after small fish.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.330
Wh-What?!

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:14.170
So you finally got caught by pirates...

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:16.000
W-we are...

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.840
That's a laugh.

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:20.710
C'mon, let's get going.

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:21.710
Okay.

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:26.700
You think small time bounty hunters
would go after these guys?!

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:31.020
Hmm?

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:35.510
Now, let's go to the restaurant.

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:39.860
They're an eyesore. Sink them.

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.190
--Yes sir!
--Yes sir!

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:48.040
He ignored us.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.540
Next time we see him,
we'll have to shut him up!

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.370
What is this...

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:56.710
They're wanted pirates, Big Sis Nami-

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:04.150
In other words, if we defeat them,
we'll get the reward money.

00:12:04.150 --> 00:12:06.640
A very profitable business,
don't you think, Big Sis?

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:17.490
W-we're in trouble.
They're aiming at us!

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:26.600
Leave it to me! Gum-Gum...

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:31.180
Slingshot!

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:52.000
Ow...

00:13:14.320 --> 00:13:15.660
Owner!

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.320
Are you all right, Head Chef Zeff?!

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:19.490
Owner, are you all right?!

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:26.990
Hmm? What happened?
Is our reservation okay?

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:33.010
Head Chef Zeff, are you really okay?

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:35.670
I'm saying it's not okay!

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:40.850
Never mind, just get back to
the restaurant already! Get to work!

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:43.350
B-but Owner, you're...

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:47.020
You idiots! Do you
want me to get angry?!

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:51.190
Feeding customers is a cook's job!

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:55.190
Are you fools trying to put my
restaurant out of business?!

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.640
We brought him in.

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:03.630
He's the one responsible.

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:09.470
I-I-I-I'm very sorry!

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:14.650
Ahhh! Your leg...

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:16.640
Idiot!!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:34.670
This didn't happen just now.

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:37.830
O-oh, then it was like
that from the beginning...

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:45.180
But you gave me bruises all over my body.

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:49.670
The medical fees and the repair charges
for the ship will cost you a lot!

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:54.020
I won't ask you to reduce the charges.

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:55.690
Oh?

00:14:55.690 --> 00:14:57.360
But...

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:58.850
I don't have money!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:04.300
You talk very candidly.

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:08.300
Well, if you don't have money,
you have no other choice but to work here.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.640
Yeah, I'll make proper amends.

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:13.310
You'll do chores unpaid for a year.

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:15.980
Okay! Chores unpaid for a year!

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:17.980
I'll let you off the hook with that.

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:24.910
A-a year?! A-a year...
You mean a year?!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.660
What's taking Luffy so long...

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:39.330
Yeah...

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:43.340
Maybe they'll make him do
chores for a month or so...

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:47.600
He should've made it the Navy's
fault instead of being foolishly honest.

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:10.300
Hey, look. Just as I thought, the man
sitting there is Lieutenant Fullbody.

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.300
He's a lieutenant at Navy Headquarters.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:13.070
Huh?

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.970
He's gorgeous. How elegant...

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:19.140
It's amazing. Everyone's looking at you.

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:22.470
<i>Well, they're admiring you.</i>

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:29.140
This is good!

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:32.490
Th-this flavor...

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:35.820
Hmm... This scent...

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:38.830
This may be the scent of the soil
of Micquo of the North Land...

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:43.000
Bitter with plenty
of body, a tad sour...

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:45.770
This wine is...

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.430
Iturutz Burger Stein!

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:53.170
Aren't I right, waiter?!

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:56.010
That's... damn wrong,

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:57.340
sir.

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:02.610
Your soup is getting cold.
Please eat it while it's hot.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:10.350
By the way, I'm Sanji, the Sous Chef.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:15.120
All the waiters ran off as of yesterday.

00:17:21.130 --> 00:17:22.370
You really shouldn't laugh.

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:25.970
But he looked so confident...

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:29.740
Do you know a lot...

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:31.310
about wine?

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:37.650
Well, yeah... although it seems my sense
of taste isn't working well today...

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:39.650
<i>Hey, what's going on?</i>

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:44.820
<i>I'm sure I requested the owner to serve
us that wine when I made a reservation.</i>

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:51.670
What do you mean by that?

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:54.660
Please reduce it to a week.

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:58.740
You talk very candidly.

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:00.340
Two weeks!

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:05.110
Hey! You wrecked my restaurant and
injured me, the Head Chef, seriously.

00:18:05.110 --> 00:18:09.950
You can't settle that with just
one or two weeks of unpaid work.

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:11.940
I've decided! Three weeks!

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:15.280
Don't talk so...

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:21.280
candidly!

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:29.740
No!

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:31.300
Hmm?

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:35.640
I've patiently waited
ten years to become a pirate.

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:38.980
I definitely don't want to
be stuck here for a year!

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:39.980
Hmm?

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:41.650
Okay, I've decided.

00:18:41.650 --> 00:18:45.320
I'll get you to let me off the hook
in a week. So I've decided.

00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:54.490
Oh? If you value time so much, I'll tell
you what you can do to settle it quickly.

00:18:54.490 --> 00:18:55.660
Ow!

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:59.500
Leave one of your legs here.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.600
No!

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:05.270
Ha! You sure talk very candidly!

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:07.540
Tap, tap... tap...

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:15.040
Yaay! Yaay! Yaaaaay!

00:19:43.810 --> 00:19:45.650
Waiter!

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:46.980
Hmm?

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:54.680
Didn't I tell you that
I'm not a waiter?

00:19:57.090 --> 00:20:00.620
But my, how beautiful you are!

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:06.670
Say Miss, would you like to have
some wine with me over there?

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:07.330
Hmm?

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:12.510
Hey! Do you serve soup with
bugs in it to customers?!

00:20:12.510 --> 00:20:13.670
Bugs?

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:17.510
What the hell is this bug?!

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:21.680
<i>Hmph! This will make this
restaurant's reputation drop sharply.</i>

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:25.690
I'm sorry, sir, but I don't know...

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:30.020
since I don't know much about insects.

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:44.030
Don't mess with me!!

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:04.990
You could've eaten it if you took
that bug out, couldn't you?

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:11.000
It took three full days
to cook it, skimming the scum...

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:15.990
Aren't you acting a bit
too big for your britches?

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:22.010
I'm a customer! I'm paying you!

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:23.680
<i>Please stop, Fullbody-san!</i>

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:24.840
Shut up!

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:29.020
<i>F-Fullbody-san...</i>

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:33.350
Can money... satisfy your hunger?

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:34.790
What'd you say?

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:39.950
I'm asking, "Can it...
satisfy your hunger?!"

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:46.030
No!

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:47.830
No! No!

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:55.030
Don't think that you can survive
in this world by repeating "No," kid.

00:21:58.550 --> 00:22:00.380
No!

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:02.470
So candid...

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:15.660
<i>F-Fullbody-san...</i>

00:22:15.660 --> 00:22:17.000
Sanji...

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:19.000
Sous Chef!

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:20.830
Hmm?

00:22:20.830 --> 00:22:22.500
A fight?

00:22:31.850 --> 00:22:35.340
Don't... waste food.

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:41.860
At sea, provoking a cook is

00:22:41.860 --> 00:22:46.190
the same as committing suicide.
Remember that.

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:36.930
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:45.420
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:52.490
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.490 --> 00:24:02.490
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
